#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "546648"
msgid "So you did make it in time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "548700"
msgid "Hm? What with the spiel, you wannabe?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549068"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF silently draws his swords."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549748"
msgid "…hmph. I know that stupid Servant\nis acting cocky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549808"
msgid "But what about you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nAm I evil, after all?\nAre our values irreconcilable?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "549904"
msgid "\"…they are,\" I nod."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550284"
msgid "Fine. Then die a pig's death.\nYou're a useless slave whose only worth\nis to pour blood over me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550460"
msgid "Why…? Why do I have to lose!?\nThis is impossible. I won't take this…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "550656"
msgid "After three losses, her mind still hasn't caved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551100"
msgid "Now, Darling. Give the requiem for her soul.\nShe announced the full severing of her ties.\nConfront her with your views."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551392"
msgid "―――I understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551580"
msgid "Fine. Try and strip me down if you can.\nHowever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552128"
msgid "―――This is the end for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552320"
msgid "Ahh…\nMy body is going to serve as her bath――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552380"
msgid "Your blood will definitely make me extra pretty.\nI mean… won't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552520"
msgid "Extol my beauty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553036"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF whispers in a stupor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553092"
msgid "The sight of her slumped on the ground makes her look weary.\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's instincts are… deep down, a\nmuch younger, innocent girl's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553460"
msgid "That's why I came here to face her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553668"
msgid "She talks about lashes, but there are no whips here.\nOnly #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's own body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553820"
msgid "Hya!?\nSto―wh-what?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553852"
msgid "Stop this!!\nD-don't touch my tail…\nI-it tickles…!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553920"
msgid "This has to be the last \"whip\" she's got.\nI'll take hold of this dragon tail she's so proud of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554128"
msgid "Hyow! Wh―hey―stupid,\naha, haha, I can't!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554176"
msgid "It tickles, I told you!\nI-I'm sensitive, around my reverse scale!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554524"
msgid "…alright, let's check."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554704"
msgid "Ahh…!\nSto―no,\nwhat are you trying to do…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554764"
msgid "Y-you can't!\nThis is so embarrassing,\nyou're skipping bases here…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554956"
msgid "Ho-ho-ho?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554968"
msgid "―as if we're holding hands…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555004"
msgid "―――Oh no."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555076"
msgid "Plus… you're being so gentle…\nN-no, we can't. We're in completely\ndifferent social classes…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555392"
msgid "…\n#C236196003Eliza#CDEF is starting to burst into tears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555532"
msgid "It's as if her dragon brain is a whipped syrup\nof sugar dissolved into honey."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555824"
msgid "Also, I've realized a certain truth:\nred twin-tails means she's one of THOSE."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556012"
msgid "I see.\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF isn't necessarily masochistic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556156"
msgid "Romance!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556168"
msgid "& Sweets!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556184"
msgid "Now this is a surprise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557108"
msgid "I-i-i-if you really wanted me to,\nI wouldn't mind describing someone like\nyou during my interviews."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557368"
msgid "Hee hee, of course.\nNo surprise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557404"
msgid "And if you really wanted,\nI could cook for you every da-yeeEHHH!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557668"
msgid "She looks she's been tossed out like a raggedy cloth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558448"
msgid "The numerous thorns nested in her mind, her:"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "558508"
msgid "Beauty Bias"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558584"
msgid "Damn, so I was wrong…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558744"
msgid "It's #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's \"crime\" and nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558864"
msgid "What troubles #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559820"
msgid "Her cries border on obsession."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559952"
msgid "That's why her third #C000246204SG#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "560004"
msgid "Purity"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "560012"
msgid "Idol"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560072"
msgid "To simply be loved and never grow up,\nto become a young and beautiful idol."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560300"
msgid "P-PERVERT!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560452"
msgid "T-this is some vicious slander…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560580"
msgid "I can't let her say what she pleases."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560632"
msgid "If I'm a groper-#[piggy][squirrelly]#, then #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF is a―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "560764"
msgid "Ahhn!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561008"
msgid "S-stop it, don't come near me―――\nI'll do whatever you say,\nplease, don't hurt me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561096"
msgid "N-no, it's tearing…!\nWhy are my clothes coming apart!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561484"
msgid "I mean, look, um,\ndoing that… means…\nMeans…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561600"
msgid "I-I-I will NEEEVVVEERR do something\nlike that, hear me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561752"
msgid "I hear her whispering."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561780"
msgid "And like, i-if we… you know, did it,\nwe would have to get married, right…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "561932"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562100"
msgid "She finally bursts into tears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562140"
msgid "Why!?\nWhy!?!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562212"
msgid "I'm an eternal, true noble!\nI mean, how could I live my life otherwise!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562360"
msgid "Never changing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562384"
msgid "That's her final pillar.\nHowever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562460"
msgid "N-no… noooooo!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562584"
msgid "Look… Look, real close.\nLook at me.\nPlease look at me, come on, come ON!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562724"
msgid "Love―\nLove is eternal, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "562968"
msgid "Don't be dumb!\nWhat's the point of being considered\nbeautiful out of pity…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563116"
msgid "That won't do…\nThere's no way I can handle that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563268"
msgid "…she probably couldn't trust herself.\nThat's why she's become so insistent now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563356"
msgid "But――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563560"
msgid "That's why I, as a true noble, must reign with\nbeauty and youth. Yes, I will NEVER become\nan ADULT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563856"
msgid "Ah, ahh… no, that's… I can't.\nIt's wonderful, yet, I can't… I can't…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564164"
msgid "…I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564180"
msgid "To accept becoming an adult, she needed\nsomeone to love her despite no longer being perfect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564820"
msgid "…this will be my last reply."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565068"
msgid "The inescapable truth I tell her is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565232"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, who was previously sobbing,\nunbelievably murmurs with composure:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565416"
msgid "All humans are able to do is judge others.\nI never once sought to be saved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565564"
msgid "I hear a raspy sound close to my ears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566732"
msgid "――――Ah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566752"
msgid "…her helpless silence weighs heavily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566804"
msgid "She can't be saved.\nShe's long past redemption."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566924"
msgid "―――, ah, ah―――\nI-I, know―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566964"
msgid "―――I know, that…\nI-I'm well aware!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567020"
msgid "…*hic, sniff*…\nWaaahhhh!\nDummy! Dummy-dummy-DUMMY!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567108"
msgid "#C236196003Eliza#CDEF starts crying like a child."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567160"
msgid "…but someone had to tell her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567208"
msgid "For her sake, no one charged her with her crimes;\nsomeone had to tell her that her time has come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567312"
msgid "Sniff… hic…!\nI know… I know, that I'm just a\nhomicidal maniac!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567452"
msgid "I'm sorry, I'm sorry―――\nI'm sorry for wanting to always be beautiful…\nI'm sorry for wanting to be in love…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567692"
msgid "You knew about me,\nyou touched my reverse scale…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567744"
msgid "But you still can't save me…\nNo one can save me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567796"
msgid "All I ever, ever wanted…\nwas to be loved forever…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567852"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF#C080080080's mind is collapsing.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568160"
msgid "―――Enough. No more.\nThere's no way I'm going to let you…\npollute me any further."
msgstr ""

